      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Theodore: Adorno",
      "content": "Adorno, the 5th Company's captain, was known as the Benevolent Knight and was semi-retired in Dornman Port. His party rescued Theodore and Lohen from Eroch. Theodore wished to inherit his title and later cared for him as his health failed, secretly with Ursa's serum. Adorno forgave them both, comforted them as when they were children, and died afterwards. He is buried; his title was not passed on.",
