      "key": [
        "Ursa's flesh",
        "Ursa serum",
        "serum",
        "experimental monsters"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Theodore",
        "Lohen"
      ],
      "comment": "Theodore: The Ursa serum",
      "content": "Eroch, working with one of Dottore's Segments, once extracted a serum from the flesh of Ursa the Drake. Theodore rediscovered the site, took over the equipment there and refined his own serum. Test animals that took it became violent and attacked one another, and escaped into the wild. Low doses helped Adorno for a while but could not cure him. A refined high-concentration version overwhelmed Theodore himself.",
