      ],
      "comment": "Theodore: Simulation Training Bubble",
      "content": "A memory-based training simulation built by Sucrose with Theodore's help. Adorno supplied memories of past foes, and Theodore was due to be the first tester until Lohen volunteered. Lohen asked to face the Rächer of Solnari, was nearly overcome by an unusual obsession, and Theodore treated him afterwards.",
